+## [Unreleased] - 0.0.6-dev.0
+
+### Added
+
+- Added first-class NotebookLM notebook creation and a bounded live
+  authentication preflight.
+- Added one-shot source-readiness polling for resumable host workflows.
+
+### Changed
+
+- Made the shared notebook library cross-process safe, atomically durable,
+  revisioned, externally refreshable, and fail-closed for unsafe or corrupt
+  files.
+- Added process/build/library freshness diagnostics to `get_health`.
+
