+## create_notebook — custom fork
+
+Create an empty notebook through the official NotebookLM homepage, register it
+in the local library, and select it as active. This is an external write and is
+not idempotent. Call only after the user asks to create a notebook. If the
+NotebookLM creation succeeds but the local library cannot be saved, the error
+contains the created URL so it can be recovered with `add_notebook`.
+
+| Name | Type | Required | Notes |
+|---|---|---|---|
+| `name` | string | no | Local display name. Defaults to a timestamped `New Notebook …` name. |
+| `description` | string | no | Local metadata description. |
+| `tags` | string[] | no | Local organization tags. |
+| `show_browser` | bool | no | Show the persistent authenticated browser. |
+| `timeout_ms` | integer | no | 5,000–120,000; default 60,000. |
+
+---
+
 ## add_notebook
 
 Add a NotebookLM share-URL to the local library. The tool description enforces a confirmation workflow on the host agent — do not call without explicit user consent.
