+## A client sees an empty or old library
+
+Current versions refresh the shared library on each read and serialize
+cross-process mutations. Inspect `instance_id`, `server_version`, and
+`library_revision` in `get_health`. If one client reports an older server
+version, reconnect that MCP client so it loads the current binary and tool
+schema. Do not delete `library.json`; invalid JSON is preserved and fails
+closed with a `.corrupt-*.bak` copy.
 
